# Forever Marksmanship Hunter, Turret (provisional: no in-game check yet; shots without weaving, the target's debuffs
# modelled from our casts): Aspect of the Hawk and Hunter's Mark before combat; Hunter's Mark on a new target and
# Serpent Sting when it drops at tier 2; Rapid Fire on cooldown; Aimed Shot, Sniper Shot under Rapid Fire or Quick
# Shots at tier 1, Arcane Shot, and Multi-Shot on more targets (after wowsims/forever's Turret APL, reference only).
# Shots only outside the deadzone (Auto Shot in range). Arcane Shot's mana floor is a setting, off by default.

actions.precombat=aspect_of_the_hawk,if=!buff.aspect_of_the_hawk.up
actions.precombat+=/hunters_mark,if=!debuff.hunters_mark.up
actions=aspect_of_the_hawk,if=!buff.aspect_of_the_hawk.up
actions+=/hunters_mark,focus=2,if=!debuff.hunters_mark.up
actions+=/rapid_fire,use_off_gcd=1
actions+=/call_action_list,name=shots,if=action.auto_shot.in_range
actions.shots=aimed_shot
actions.shots+=/serpent_sting,focus=2,if=!debuff.serpent_sting.up
actions.shots+=/sniper_shot,focus=1,if=buff.rapid_fire.up|buff.quick_shots.up
actions.shots+=/arcane_shot,if=mana.pct>=settings.arcane_shot_mana
actions.shots+=/multi_shot,if=active_enemies>1
